==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|24px]] '''Silk StarTrim_CubicNStar''' command creates a blended corner collar, a StarTrim_CubicNStar object, from a [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|blended corner surface]].

[[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66-01.png|200px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|16px|link=]]
[[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar-01.png|200px]]

{{Caption|A [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|blended corner surface]] → Resulting blended corner collar}}

==Usage==

# Select a [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|blended corner surface]]
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|16px]] StarTrim_CubicNStar}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_StarTrim_CubicNStar.svg|16px]] StarTrim_CubicNStar}} option from the menu.
# A blended corner collar, a '''StarTrim_CubicNStar''' object, is created.

==Notes==

* If eliminating pinching in poor corner geometry is required in a [[Image:Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicNStarSurface_NStar66|blended multi corner surface]], this tool can cut-out its center, leaving a collar that can be patched with a standard Filling surface.
: (- Which tool(s) could be used, and how to obtain the edge curves? -)

==Properties==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A blended corner collar, a '''StarTrim_CubicNStar''' object, is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|StarTrim_CubicNStar}}

* {{PropertyData|CubicNStar|Link}}: Base Surface star.
* {{PropertyData|NSurf_center|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: N Cubic Surfaces, center section.
* {{PropertyData|NSurf_lag|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: N Cubic Surfaces, lagging edge section.
* {{PropertyData|NSurf_lead|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: N Cubic Surfaces, leading edge section.
* {{PropertyData|NSurf_main|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: N Cubic Surfaces, main corner section.



